          "text": {
            "en": "Monoclonal antibody to PCSK9",
            "ru": "Моноклональное антитело к PCSK9"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "~60",
            "ru": "~60"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": {
            "en": "Yes (1-12 mo post ACS)",
